      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;일상 공간과 특수 용도를 위한 섬유 솔루션 
    &lt;div id=&#34;일상-공간과-특수-용도를-위한-섬유-솔루션&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%ec%9d%bc%ec%83%81-%ea%b3%b5%ea%b0%84%ea%b3%bc-%ed%8a%b9%ec%88%98-%ec%9a%a9%eb%8f%84%eb%a5%bc-%ec%9c%84%ed%95%9c-%ec%84%ac%ec%9c%a0-%ec%86%94%eb%a3%a8%ec%85%98&#34; aria-label=&#34;앵커&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
